## Building a Grade Calculator

### Grade Scale

```xiom
fn score_to_letter(score: Int) -> Str {
  if score >= 90 { return "A"; };
  if score >= 80 { return "B"; };
  if score >= 70 { return "C"; };
  if score >= 60 { return "D"; };
  "F"
}

fn score_to_gpa(score: Int) -> Float64 {
  if score >= 90 { return 4.0; };
  if score >= 80 { return 3.0; };
  if score >= 70 { return 2.0; };
  if score >= 60 { return 1.0; };
  0.0
}
```

### Simple Average

```xiom
fn calculate_average(scores: &Vec[Int]) -> Int {
  if scores.len() == 0 { return 0; };
  let mut sum = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < scores.len() {
    sum += scores.get(i).unwrap();
    i += 1;
  };
  sum / scores.len()
}
```

### Weighted Average

```xiom
type WeightedScore {
  score: Int;
  weight: Int;
}

fn calculate_weighted_average(items: &Vec[WeightedScore]) -> Int {
  let mut total_weight = 0;
  let mut weighted_sum = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < items.len() {
    let item = items.get(i).unwrap();
    weighted_sum += item.score * item.weight;
    total_weight += item.weight;
    i += 1;
  };

  if total_weight == 0 { return 0; };
  weighted_sum / total_weight
}
```

### Course Grade Report

```xiom
fn print_grade_report(scores: &Vec[Int]) {
  let avg = calculate_average(scores);
  let letter = score_to_letter(avg);
  io.println(avg);
  io.println(letter);

  let mut i = 0;
  while i < scores.len() {
    io.println(scores.get(i).unwrap());
    i += 1;
  };
}
```

### Grading Policies

Common weighting: Homework 20%, Midterm 30%, Final 50%. Or: Quiz 10%, Project 25%, Midterm 25%, Final 40%.

